            <link>https://www.nature.com/articles/s43247-026-04229-w</link>
            <content:encoded>
                &lt;p&gt;Communications Earth &amp;amp; Environment, Published online: 26 November 2026; &lt;a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s43247-026-04229-w"&gt;doi:10.1038/s43247-026-04229-w&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;An attention-based deep learning framework with spatially varying physical predictors outperforms operational forecasts for tropical cyclone intensity at 24–48-hour lead times, reducing 24-hour mean absolute error and capturing thermodynamic mechanisms of intensity change.</content:encoded>
